# Regenerable image formats. The manuscript \includegraphics only PDFs (32 of
# them); the PNG/SVG siblings are build products of the same scripts. Note that
# .gitignore does not untrack anything: the 50 PNGs already in the repo stay
# tracked and keep showing modifications. This only stops *new* ones from
# accumulating as untracked noise. Drop these two lines if the PNGs are wanted
# for slides or a README.
figures/*.png
figures/*.svg

